      "correct": "2",
      "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2fca8cbba9c8540730f1789bb3d8eca414c7a61b57fc3d33b298e5ff23a0cbd.png] \n\nGiven, AB = BD = DC\n\nAnd ∠BAD = 70°\n\nIn ΔABD,\n\n⇒ ∠BAD = ∠BDA = 70° [∵ AB = BD]\n\n⇒ ∠ABD + ∠BAD + ∠BDA = 180°\n\n⇒ ∠ABD = 180° – 70° – 70° = 40°\n\n⇒ ∠BDC = 180° – ∠BDA = 180° – 70° = 110°\n\nIn ΔBDC,\n\n⇒ ∠DBC = ∠DCB [∵ BD = DC]\n\n⇒ ∠DBC + ∠BDC + ∠DCB = 180°\n\n⇒ 2∠DBC = 180° – 110° = 70°\n\n⇒ ∠DBC = 35°\n\n⇒ ∠ABC = ∠ABD + ∠DBC = 40° + 35° = 75°\n\n31:T",
