      "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5ef430a5554a9f86ed2684746aca5c4ffc118493a6058d821aa9e3fa024e7026.png] \n\n∠ABC = 72°\n\n∠ABC = ∠ACB = 72° [AB = AC]\n\nIn ΔABC\n\n∠ABC + ∠ACB + ∠BAC = 180°\n\n⇒ 72° + 72° + ∠BAC = 180°\n\n⇒ ∠BAC = 180° - 144° = 36°",
