      "solution": "**Given:**\n\nlargest angle = 80°\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSmallest angle = Largest angle - 40° = 80° - 40° = 40°\n\nWe know that the sum of angles of a triangle = 180°\n\nThird angle = 180° - (Sum of largest and smallest angle) = 180° - (80° + 40°) = 180° - 120° = 60°\n\n∴ Third angle = 60°",
